:: Deadwood Reblooms Orphanage Widgets [widget]

<<widget 'deadwood-finance-orphanage-office-link'>>
  <<if _options is 1 and maplebirch.get('Finance').orphanage.canNegotiate>>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Discuss ending your rent payments (0:05)', '谈谈不再交租的事 (0:05)'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Orphanage Buyout'>>
      <<pass 5>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if _options is 1 and maplebirch.get('Finance')?.orphanage.canManageAdoption>>
    <<icon 'finance/adoption-file.png'>><<lanLink ["Check adoption enquiry (0:05)", '查看收养意向 (0:05)'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Orphanage Adoption'>>
      <<pass 5>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<deadwood-orphanage-donation-office>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-finance-orphanage-adoption-refused-gate'>>
  <<goto 'Deadwood Reblooms Orphanage Adoption Refused Gate'>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-finance-orphanage-robin-link'>>
  <<if maplebirch.get('Finance').orphanage.canTalkRobin>>
    <<if $Finance.orphanage.robin_bought_out and !$Finance.orphanage.robin_told>>
      <<socialiseicon>><<lanLink ['Show Robin the receipt (0:05)', '把回执给罗宾看 (0:05)'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Orphanage Receipt'>>
        <<pass 5>>
      <</lanLink>><br>
    <<elseif $Finance.orphanage.offer isnot null and !$Finance.orphanage.agreed and !$Finance.orphanage.robin_bought_out and !$RobinExpansion?.bailey_defeated>>
      <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ["Discuss Bailey's offer (0:10)", '和罗宾谈谈贝利的报价 (0:10)'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Orphanage Robin'>>
        <<pass 10>>
      <</lanLink>><br>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-finance-orphanage-name'>>
  <<if _args[0] is 'pc'>>
    <<lanSwitch 'You' '你'>>
  <<elseif _args[0] is 'robin'>>
    <<lanSwitch 'Robin' '罗宾'>>
  <<else>>
    <<lanSwitch 'You and Robin' '你和罗宾'>>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Orphanage Buyout
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'home'>><<effects>><<npc Bailey>><<person1>>
<<if maplebirch.get('Finance').orphanage.canNegotiate>>
  <<if $Finance.orphanage.offer is null>>
    <<set $Finance.orphanage.offer to maplebirch.get('Finance').orphanage.prices>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You ask how much Bailey would want to stop collecting rent. <<He>> stops writing.
        "Yours? Robin's? Both?" <<He>> looks you over, then pulls two sheets from the drawer. "Each name has a price."
        The pen scratches across the paper. <<He>> turns the sheets towards you, keeping a hand on the corner.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你问贝利，要多少钱才肯不再收租。<<He>>停下笔。
        “你的？罗宾的？还是两个人？”<<He>>打量了你一会儿，从抽屉里抽出两张纸。“一个名字，一个价。”
        笔尖在纸上划过。<<He>>把两张纸转向你，一只手仍按着纸角。
    <</language>>
  <<elseif !$Finance.orphanage.agreed>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Bailey finds the quotes in <<his>> drawer and pushes them across the desk. "Same prices. If you want Robin's name taken off, I want <<nnpc_his 'Robin'>> signature too."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        贝利从抽屉里找出两份报价，推到你面前。“价钱没变。想把罗宾的名字划掉，那份也得由<<nnpc_him 'Robin'>>签。”
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You put Robin's signed sheet on the desk. Bailey reads the name, then looks at you.
        "Got the money?"
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你把罗宾签过字的那份放在桌上。贝利看过名字，抬眼看你。
        “钱带来了吗？”
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "Pay for a name, and I stop collecting from that person. The room stays theirs. Come and go as they like."
      Bailey taps the figures. "Anything still on the ledger goes on top. Anyone you leave out keeps paying."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      “付了谁的钱，就不再收谁的周租。房间留着，住不住随便。”
      贝利用笔点了点数目。“账上还欠着的，另算。没付到的那个，照旧交租。”
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<deadwood-card 'Rent buyout' '房租买断'>>
    <<for _orphanage_offer range maplebirch.get('Finance').orphanage.offers>>
      <<capture _orphanage_offer>>
        <b><<deadwood-finance-orphanage-name _orphanage_offer.id>></b><br>
        <<lanSwitch 'Buyout: ' '买断金额：'>><<deadwood-reblooms-finance-money _orphanage_offer.price>><br>
        <<if _orphanage_offer.arrears gt 0>>
          <<lanSwitch 'Outstanding rent: ' '未付房租：'>><<deadwood-reblooms-finance-money _orphanage_offer.arrears>><br>
        <</if>>
        <<lanSwitch 'Total: ' '合计：'>><<deadwood-reblooms-finance-money _orphanage_offer.total>><br>
        <<if _orphanage_offer.payable>>
          <<shopicon 'register'>><<lanLink ['Pay in full (0:10)', '付清 (0:10)'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Orphanage Buyout Finish'>>
            <<set $Finance.orphanage.choice to _orphanage_offer.id>>
          <</lanLink>><br>
        <<elseif _orphanage_offer.id isnot 'pc' and !$Finance.orphanage.agreed>>
          <span class='blue'><i><<lanSwitch 'Talk to Robin before paying for this.' '先和罗宾谈谈，再付这份钱。'>></i></span><br>
        <<elseif Time.hour is 9 and Time.minute gte 50>>
          <span class='blue'><<lanSwitch 'Come back tomorrow morning with time to settle this.' '明早留够时间再来结清。'>></span><br>
        <<else>>
          <span class='red'><<lanSwitch 'You cannot settle this payment now.' '你现在没法结清这笔钱。'>></span><br>
        <</if>>
        <br>
      <</capture>>
    <</for>>
  <</deadwood-card>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      There is nothing to settle with Bailey now.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      现在没法和贝利谈这件事。
  <</language>><br>
<</if>>
<<main_hall_icon>><<lanLink ['Return to the hall (0:01)', '返回大厅 (0:01)'] 'Orphanage'>><<pass 1>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Orphanage Robin
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'home'>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if maplebirch.get('Finance').orphanage.canTalkRobin and $Finance.orphanage.offer isnot null and !$Finance.orphanage.agreed and !$Finance.orphanage.robin_bought_out>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin takes the sheet with <<his>> name on it and reads it twice. "That's a lot of money." <<He>> looks up at you, then back at the figure.
      "And we could still stay here?"
      <br><br>
      You point to the line about your rooms. Robin follows it with a finger.
      "I'd like that. Not having to count it out every week." <<He>> pauses.
      "But only if you can afford it. Don't borrow it from someone worse."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾接过写着自己名字的那张纸，看了两遍。“好多钱。”<<He>>抬眼看你，又低头看了一遍数目。
      “付完之后，还能住在这里？”
      <br><br>
      你指给<<him>>看保留房间的那一行。罗宾用手指顺着读下去。
      “那就好了。不用每周都数一遍钱。”<<He>>停了一会儿。
      “不过，你得付得起。别为了这件事，去向更糟的人借钱。”
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<socialiseicon>><<lanLink ['Agree to the terms together', '一起同意这份条款'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Orphanage Robin Agree'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ["Return to Robin's room", '返回罗宾的房间'] 'Robin Options'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Orphanage Robin Agree
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'home'>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if maplebirch.get('Finance').orphanage.canTalkRobin and $Finance.orphanage.offer isnot null and !$Finance.orphanage.agreed and !$Finance.orphanage.robin_bought_out>>
  <<set $Finance.orphanage.agreed to true>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You pass Robin the pen. <<He>> carefully signs the sheet with <<his>> name on it, then folds it along its old crease.
      "Keep a copy," <<he>> says, handing it back. "I don't want <<nnpc_him 'Bailey'>> changing it."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你把笔递给罗宾。<<He>>在写着自己名字的那张纸上认真签好字，沿旧折痕把纸折起来。
      “留一份。”<<He>>把纸递回来。“我不想让<<nnpc_him 'Bailey'>>再改。”
  <</language>>
  <<npcincr Robin love 2>><<glove>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ["Return to Robin's room", '返回罗宾的房间'] 'Robin Options'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Orphanage Buyout Finish
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'home'>><<effects>><<npc Bailey>><<person1>>
<<if maplebirch.get('Finance').orphanage.buyout($Finance.orphanage.choice)>>
  <<pass 10>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Bailey checks the payment, then checks it again. You sign the receipt. <<His>> pen draws a line beneath the name you have paid for in the rent ledger.
      <<if $Finance.orphanage.choice is 'both'>>Another line crosses out the other name.<</if>>
      "There. We're square." <<He>> signs the sheet, tears off a receipt, and pushes both across the desk.
      <br><br>
      You ask about the room. Bailey glances at the receipt. "Keep the keys. That's paid for too."
      <<He>> pulls the ledger back. The other names are still there.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      贝利核过款项，又核了一遍。你在回执上签好字。<<He>>拿起笔，在房租账本上给你付过款的名字划了线。
      <<if $Finance.orphanage.choice is 'both'>>另一个名字也被划掉了。<</if>>
      “行了，两清。”<<He>>在纸上签字，撕下一张回执，一起推过桌面。
      <br><br>
      你问起房间。贝利瞥了一眼回执。“钥匙留着。房间的钱也付过了。”
      <<He>>把账本拉回去。其他人的名字还在上面。
  <</language>>
  <br><br><span class='green'>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<deadwood-finance-orphanage-name $Finance.orphanage.choice>>: no further rent collection. The original room remains available.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<deadwood-finance-orphanage-name $Finance.orphanage.choice>>的房租已买断，原房间仍能使用。
    <</language>>
  </span><br>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The payment cannot go through. You keep the sheet and your money.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      这笔款项没能付清。你收好纸，把钱留在自己手里。
  <</language>><br>
<</if>>
<<main_hall_icon>><<lanLink ['Return to the hall (0:01)', '返回大厅 (0:01)'] 'Orphanage'>><<pass 1>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Orphanage Receipt
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'home'>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if maplebirch.get('Finance').orphanage.canTalkRobin and $Finance.orphanage.robin_bought_out and !$Finance.orphanage.robin_told>>
  <<set $Finance.orphanage.robin_told to true>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin reads Bailey's signature, then the receipt. <<He>> sits on the edge of the bed, still holding both.
      "So that's it?" <<He>> gives a short laugh, then checks the paper again.
      <<if $Finance.orphanage.pc_bought_out>>
        "Both of us. We can stay. Or go."
      <<else>>
        "What about yours?" You tell <<him>> that your rent is still due each week. Robin lowers the receipt. "Thank you. I wish yours was on here too."
      <</if>>
      <br><br>
      <<if C.npc.Robin.dom gte 60>>
        <<He>> puts the receipt safely in a drawer. "Let's keep the keys. I want to leave when we decide to."
      <<else>>
        <<He>> looks around the room. "I'd like to stay tonight." <<His>> hand finds yours. "If that's okay."
      <</if>>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾看过贝利的签名，又看了回执。<<He>>在床沿坐下，仍攥着两张纸。
      “这样就好了？”<<He>>短促地笑了一声，又低头核了一遍。
      <<if $Finance.orphanage.pc_bought_out>>
        “我们两个，想住就住，想走就走。”
      <<else>>
        “你那份呢？”你告诉<<him>>，自己的房租还得按周交。罗宾放低了回执。“谢谢。我真希望你的名字也在上面。”
      <</if>>
      <br><br>
      <<if C.npc.Robin.dom gte 60>>
        <<He>>把回执收进抽屉。“钥匙留着。等我们自己想走了，再走。”
      <<else>>
        <<He>>环顾房间。“今晚还是想住这里。”<<He>>握住你的手。“可以吗？”
      <</if>>
  <</language>>
  <<npcincr Robin love 3>><<npcincr Robin trauma -5>><<glove>><<lrtrauma>><br><br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ["Return to Robin's room", '返回罗宾的房间'] 'Robin Options'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Orphanage Adoption
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'home'>><<effects>><<npc Bailey>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You notice a stiff, heavy envelope embossed with an upscale seal tucked under a brass paperweight on Bailey's desk. It is a formal enquiry memorandum regarding the transfer of your orphanage ward guardianship, bearing Avery's private crest.<br><br>
    <<if $Finance.orphanage.avery_adoption_refused>>
      Beside the envelope lies your previous declaration, firmly stamped with Bailey's seal and stating in writing that you reject any adoption or private guardianship transfer by Avery. Bailey taps the desk. "Your note is still on file. If Avery brings another check, I will slide it right back. Have you had second thoughts?"
    <<else>>
      Bailey leans back in the desk chair, folding <<his>> arms as <<he>> watches you glance at the paper. "Avery has been asking about your custody papers," Bailey says, tapping the corner of the envelope. "Dropped off an enquiry note and promised another donation. In the usual run of things, I make that choice. <<if $Finance.orphanage.pc_bought_out>>Not that you owe me anything anymore—you bought out your own release, so I have no legal right to sell you off.<<else>>But if you intend to stay here, you had better make up your mind before Avery brings the check.<</if>>"
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你注意到贝利办公桌的黄铜镇纸下，压着一封盖有高档火漆印的硬质信函。那是来自多瑙河街宅邸的正式文书，上面印着艾弗里的私人纹章，赫然是一份针对你监护权转让与领养的意向备忘录。<br><br>
    <<if $Finance.orphanage.avery_adoption_refused>>
      信函旁放着你先前的书面声明，上面盖着孤儿院的公章，清晰写明了你拒绝任何来自艾弗里的私人领养与监护权转让。贝利敲了敲桌面。“你的字条还压在档案里。艾弗里要是再派人拿支票来，我自然会直接退回去。怎么，你想改主意了？”
    <<else>>
      贝利靠在椅背上，抱着双臂打量着你的神色。“艾弗里之前打听过你的监护权，”贝利抬手点了点信函一角，“送了这份意向便条过来，还许诺了一笔可观的捐款。换作平时，这事轮不到你多嘴。<<if $Finance.orphanage.pc_bought_out>>不过你早就把自己那份账结清了，我现在可没权拿一个自由人换钱。<<else>>但你要是打算留在孤儿院，最好趁艾弗里还没把支票送来前，自己先拿个主意。<</if>>”
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<if !$Finance.orphanage.avery_adoption_refused>>
  <<refuseicon>><<lanLink ['Sign refusal of Avery\'s adoption', '签字拒绝收养'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Orphanage Adoption Decision'>>
    <<set $Finance.orphanage.avery_adoption_refused to true>>
  <</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<socialiseicon>><<lanLink ['Withdraw your refusal', '撤销拒绝声明'] 'Deadwood Reblooms Orphanage Adoption Decision'>>
    <<set $Finance.orphanage.avery_adoption_refused to false>>
  <</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Leave the office', '离开办公室'] 'Bailey\'s Office'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Orphanage Adoption Decision
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'home'>><<effects>><<npc Bailey>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<if $Finance.orphanage.avery_adoption_refused>>
      You take up the pen and write your name firmly across the refusal declaration. Bailey inspects the ink, presses the orphanage stamp over your signature, and files the paper in the desk drawer. "Suit yourself," Bailey says. "With that on record, no donation from Avery will buy your papers out from under you. I will tell them you refused."
    <<else>>
      You ask Bailey to return your earlier refusal note and tear it in half. Bailey shrugs and tosses the scraps into the wastebasket. "Fine. If Avery arrives with a donation to buy custody, don't expect me to turn the money away on your behalf."
    <</if>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<if $Finance.orphanage.avery_adoption_refused>>
      你拿起笔，在拒绝声明的底栏稳稳签下自己的名字。贝利看了看墨迹，拿起孤儿院的图章重重盖在签名上，随后将文件归入抽屉。“随你的便，”贝利说。“白纸黑字留在这里，不管艾弗里出多少捐款，孤儿院都无权替你转让监护权。等对方找上门，我会明确告诉他们你拒绝了。”
    <<else>>
      你从贝利手中要回先前的拒绝字条，当面撕成了两半。贝利耸了耸肩，把纸屑扫进纸篓里。“行。要是艾弗里带着大笔捐赠登门要办收养，可别指望我会替你挡回去。”
    <</if>>
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to desk', '返回桌前'] 'Bailey\'s Office'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>

:: Deadwood Reblooms Orphanage Adoption Refused Gate
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'home'>><<effects>>
<<npc Avery>><<npc Bailey 2>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Avery stands in Bailey's office with an assured smile, sliding a signed bank draft across the desk. "I believe this donation will more than compensate for the orphanage's care of <<pcpetname 'Avery'>>."<br><br>
    <<person2>>
    Bailey glances at the amount on the slip, but does not pick it up. Instead, <<he>> rests two fingers against the corner and slides it straight back across the polished wood.<br><br>
    <<if $Finance.orphanage.pc_bought_out>>
      "You're too late," Bailey says coldly. "This one already paid off <<his>> full release in hard cash. I don't hold the custody papers anymore, and I don't sell people who aren't mine to sell."
    <<else>>
      "Save your ink," Bailey says flatly. "The kid already filed a signed, witnessed refusal in writing. It's locked in my drawer. I'm keeping my word on that paper. Take your draft and leave."
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<person1>>
    Avery's polished smile stiffens. <<He>> looks from Bailey's unyielding expression to you, <<his>> jaw tightening as <<he>> realizes the arrangement has failed. Avery retrieves the draft from the desk, folds it into an inner pocket, and turns on <<his>> heel without another word.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    艾弗里站在贝利的办公室里，神色从容，带着自信的微笑将一张签好的支票滑过桌面。“我相信这笔赞助，足以补偿孤儿院对<<pcpetname 'Avery'>>的抚养之恩。”<br><br>
    <<person2>>
    贝利瞥了一眼支票上的数额，却没有伸手去拿。相反，<<he>>伸出两根手指按住纸角，将支票原封不动地推了回去。<br><br>
    <<if $Finance.orphanage.pc_bought_out>>
      “你来晚了，”贝利冷冷地说道。“这孩子早就用真金白银把自己的赎金一次性结清了。我手里已经没有这孩子的监护权了，更没兴趣拿一个自由身的人来换赞助。”
    <<else>>
      “省省你的墨水吧，”贝利平淡地说道。“这孩子已经在办公室留下了书面签字，明确拒绝由你收养。白纸黑字锁在我的抽屉里。我说过认那张单子，就不会收你的钱。拿着支票走人。”
    <</if>>
    <br><br>
    <<person1>>
    艾弗里脸上的从容笑意瞬间僵住了。<<He>>看了看贝利冷漠坚决的脸，又看了看你，咬紧了牙关，终于意识到这次势在必得的收养企图彻底落了空。艾弗里收起桌上的支票，折好塞回大衣内袋，一言不发地拂袖而去。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<main_hall_icon>><<lanLink ['Return to the hall', '返回大厅'] 'Orphanage'>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</lanLink>><br>
